  "title": "OPC UA: Add Ethernet Type 0xB62C",
  "description": "Ethernet Type 0xB62C is the dedicated identifier used for OPC UA Ethernet.\n\nIn industrial automation, this EtherType is utilized by the OPC UA PubSub (Publish-Subscribe) architecture to transport UADP NetworkMessages directly as the payload of an Ethernet II frame. By bypassing the traditional IP and UDP network layers, it minimizes overhead and transmission latency for real-time industrial communication.\n\nPing #15864",
